:: Skill Check Difficulty Widget [nobr widget]

/* This widget will display the percentage chance of the PC passing a skill check. It uses the same info as the normal skill check, but just provides different information. 
*/

<<widget "skillDiff">>

<<set _skill to _args[0]>>
<<set _difficulty to _args[1]>>
<<if _args[2] != null>>
    <<set _other to _args[2]>>
<<else>>
    <<set _other to null>>
<</if>>

<<skillCheck _skill _difficulty _other>>

(_percent%)

<</widget>>